## Arc VM flags. See README.md, "Operations".

## Maximum processes and ports. Every client connection is one process and one port,
## so these must exceed the connection ceiling with room to spare.
+P 5000000
+Q 2000000

## Kernel poll for large numbers of sockets (on by default on modern OTP; explicit here).
+K true

## Do not let idle schedulers spin; in containers that shows up as phantom CPU usage.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

## Larger distribution buffer for cross-node fan-out in a cluster.
+zdbbl 131072
